  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.restock">Ombor to'ldirish va yaroqlilik muddati</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.switchCashier">Kassirni almashtirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.title">Kassirni almashtirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.message">Keyingi kassirning login va parolini kiriting. To'g'ri ma'lumotlar kiritilguncha joriy smena yopiladi (oddiy smena yopish kabi) — hech narsa o'zgarmaydi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.emailWatermark">Email</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.passwordWatermark">Parol</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="switchCashier.confirmButton">Almashtirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.tabReorder">Ombor to'ldirish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.reorderSubtitle">Ushbu kassada qayd etilgan sotuvlar asosida hisoblanadi. Agar hali sotuvlar bo'lmasa yoki yangilanishdan beri bir necha kundan kam vaqt o'tgan bo'lsa, bo'sh bo'ladi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.lookbackLabel">Sotuv tezligini shu davr uchun hisoblash:</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colDailyRate">Sotuv/kun</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colDaysLeft">Yetadi</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.reorderEmpty">Bashorat uchun hali sotuv tarixi yo'q. "Serverdan tarixni yuklash" tugmasini bosing yoki bir necha kun kuting — kassa har bir sotuvdan keyin o'z ma'lumotlarini yig'adi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.backfillButton">Serverdan tarixni yuklash</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.tabExpiry">Yaroqlilik muddati</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.expirySubtitle">Yaroqlilik muddati — mahsulot toifasiga qarab taxminiy baho (AI kaliti bo'lmasa haqiqiy internet qidiruvi yo'q, sozlamalarga qarang). Kelish sanasi — mahsulot ushbu kassada birinchi marta qoldiqqa ega bo'lgan sana.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colIntakeDate">Kelgan</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.colExpiryDate">Muddati</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="restock.expiryEmpty">Hali kelish sanasi ma'lum bo'lgan mahsulotlar yo'q — mahsulot qoldiqqa ega bo'lishi bilanoq avtomatik qayd etiladi.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyTitle">Sodiqlik dasturi</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltySubtitle">Balans ushbu kassada mahalliy saqlanadi — NurCRM'da hali mijoz ballari uchun maydon yo'q.</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyEnable">Ballarni yoqish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="posSettings.operations.loyaltyEarnPercent">Chek summasidan foiz</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.logout">Chiqish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.exitApp">Ish stoliga chiqish</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="csh.menu.newBadge">Yangi</x:String>

